description.narrative:
Overall objective:

Contribute to strengthen integrity and governance in Burkina Faso.

Specific Objectives:

1) Strengthen citizens' knowledge of the mechanism for the fight against corruption in Burkina Faso;

2) Contribute to strengthening the institutional mechanism for the fight against corruption in Burkina Faso;

3) Contribute to increasing the judicial processing of economic crime cases, in particular cases of ill-gotten gains;

4) Strengthen the empowerment of REN-LAC and MBDHP.
